    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Checks if side-menu is visible on login" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Check Side-menu on Login</p>
            <p>Confirms that the side menu is displayed after logging in and that the "Dashboard" option is present.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
            <step>Ensure the user is logged in and the dashboard is loaded.</step>
            <step>Verify `.left-menu` element is visible.</step>
            <step>Verify the "Dashboard" text is present in the menu.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Side menu is visible and contains a "Dashboard" entry.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
    </chapter>

